221
00:16:10,859 --> 00:16:14,980
[SPEAKER_01]: When he becomes completely disenchanted with these two things, he makes an end to suffering.

222
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:17,460
[SPEAKER_01]: That's name and form.

223
00:16:19,661 --> 00:16:22,321
[SPEAKER_02]: And then the third one... That's everything that appears.

224
00:16:22,682 --> 00:16:23,442
[SPEAKER_02]: It's name and form.

225
00:16:26,904 --> 00:16:28,245
[SPEAKER_01]: The third one is what three is.

226
00:16:28,665 --> 00:16:30,267
[SPEAKER_01]: Three kinds of feeling.

227
00:16:30,287 --> 00:16:30,527
[SPEAKER_02]: Right.

228
00:16:30,567 --> 00:16:34,850
[SPEAKER_02]: So, it's getting more specific, basically.

229
00:16:35,851 --> 00:16:43,838
